BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.5 Tm /F1 10 Tf 13.5 TL (Halcyon tracks the nine major allergens: milk, eggs, fish, shellfish, tree nuts, peanuts, wheat, soy, and) Tj T* (sesame. Almond milk and the hazelnut and pistachio syrups contain tree nuts. Oat milk is not certified) Tj T* (gluten-free. Each pastry's allergens are printed on its label and listed in the allergen binder.) Tj T* ET
