BT 1 0 0 1 0 57.5 Tm /F1 10 Tf 13.5 TL (When a guest mentions an allergy, add the ALLERGY modifier in the register so it prints on the cup) Tj T* (label. The barista making the drink washes their hands, takes a pitcher from the clean rack, purges and) Tj T* (wipes the steam wand before steaming, and uses the purple allergen-safe blender jar for blended) Tj T* (drinks. Tell the guest that our caf\351s handle all nine allergens and we can't promise any item is free of) Tj T* (them.) Tj T* ET
